OL,3,GNEWSAMan finds car he had to sell in
OL,4,A1991 on eBay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who sold a car he described as
OL,7,Fhis "pride and joy" has been reunited
OL,8,Fwith it 35 years later after finding it
OL,9,Fon an internet auction site.
OL,11,FDavid Reynolds, from Swineshead,
OL,12,FLincolnshire, said the 1972 Lotus
OL,13,FEuropa was sold during a divorce in
OL,14,F1991.
OL,16,FIn September he found it in Sheffield
OL,17,Fon eBay after recognising distinctive
OL,18,Falterations he made to the interior.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
