OL,3,GNEWSAMan finds car he had to sell in
OL,4,A1991 on eBay
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I had a job to sleep", he said about
OL,7,Fthe night he rediscovered it, adding he
OL,8,Fhad no regrets about spending #16,080
OL,9,Frebuying the car, after selling it for
OL,10,F#4,000.
